description:
Create a reusable table widget in src/ui/components/table.rs

Features:
- Column specification (name, width, alignment)
- Header row with blue styling
- Row rendering with proper column alignment
- Selection highlighting for rows
- Automatic column width calculation option

API:
```rust
pub struct Column {
    pub name: String,
    pub width: usize,
    pub align: Align, // Left, Right, Center
}

pub struct Table {
    columns: Vec<Column>,
}

impl Table {
    pub fn render_header(&self, frame, area, colors);
    pub fn render_row(&self, frame, y, values: &[String], style);
}
```

Used by: git config, beads list, proc views
